{"data":{"repository":{"pullRequest":{"number":528,"title":"feat(M6-19B): access/secret/audit review — periodic evidence + rotation checker","author":{"login":"skyosv10-art"},"mergedBy":{"login":"skyosv10-art"},"mergedAt":"2026-09-28T05:27:48Z","createdAt":"2026-09-28T05:03:34Z","merged":true,"reviewDecision":null,"baseRefName":"main","headRefOid":"2b1ae7c99dee2e3a04bf4a9e9a2e47d4305df87f","mergeCommit":{"oid":"0f2c8482d04a5292a2e1314737352c1cbcc04f28","parents":{"totalCount":1,"nodes":[{"oid":"30da701d4c8ca46bc0d31b79a81fc59a83f30171"}]},"committedDate":"2026-09-28T05:27:48Z","message":"feat(M6-19B): access/secret/audit review — periodic evidence + rotation checker (#528)\n\n* feat(M6-19B): access/secret/audit review — periodic evidence + rotation checker\n\nCLM-0389 · M6-19B\n\nAccess, secret, and audit review procedures for launch readiness:\n\n1. ACCESS_SECRET_AUDIT_REVIEW.md — comprehensive review document:\n   - Repository access review (quarterly, GitHub collaborator audit)\n   - Service identity review (quarterly, token-bound operation count)\n   - Database access review (quarterly, connection string rotation)\n   - Secret rotation verification (26 secrets, 5 categories, schedule)\n   - Audit log integrity (monthly, append-only, gap detection SQL)\n   - Evidence collection schedule (quarterly/monthly/continuous)\n   - Exit criteria checklist (all met)\n\n2. validate-secret-rotation.sh — Check 24 in governance suite:\n   - 8 gates: JSON validity, rotation_frequency, status, BLOCKED reasons,\n     consumers, environments, count, allowed frequencies\n   - 8/8 PASS on initial run\n\n3. Baseline evidence in ci-evidence/2026-09-28T080000Z-m6-19b-access-review-baseline/:\n   - raw-collaborators.json (1: skyosv10-art)\n   - raw-branch-protection.json (40 contexts, strict, enforce_admins)\n   - CODEOWNERS-snapshot.txt\n   - secret-inventory-snapshot.json (26 secrets)\n   - secret-rotation-check-output.txt (8/8 pass)\n\nExit criteria: periodic evidence — all met.\nSta